<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Allied Colloids upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Allied Colloids upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Colloids Group Plc Plc was raised to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;sell&quot; at BZW, market sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available and analysts at BZW could not be reached for comment.</p>
<p>The stock was unchanged at 128-1/2p.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
